      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/maani-al-akhbar:348:2",
      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/28/1/350/2",
      "text": [
        ": حدثنا محمد بن يحيى، عن أحمد بن محمد، ومحمد بن الحسين عن محمد بن يحيى الخثعمي، عن غياث بن إبراهيم، عن أبي عبد الله عليه السلام، عن أبيه، عن جده عليهما السلام، قال: قال علي صلوات الله عليه: لا تقولوا: رمضان ولكن قولوا: شهر رمضان فإنكم لا تدرون ما رمضان."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.basel-kadem": [
          "2.\tMy father, may Allah grant him mercy, said: We were told by Muhammed bin Yahya, from Ahmad bin Muhammed, and Muhammed bin Hussain, from Muhammed bin Yahya al-Khath’ami, from Ghiyath bin Ibrahim, from Abu Abdillah, peace be upon him, from his father, from his grandfather, peace be upon them both, that he said: Ali, Allah’s blessings be upon him, said: Do not say: «Ramadhan», however, say: «the Month of Ramadhan», for indeed, you do not know what Ramadhan is."
        ]
      }
    },
